# ── Media / data sources ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Jikan (anime/manga) and TVMaze (TV) need NO keys — they're always on.
# TMDB + OMDb make movie coverage much better. Grab free keys here:
#   TMDB: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
#   OMDb: https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx
TMDB_API_KEY=
OMDB_API_KEY=

# ── LLM (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint works. Without a key, answers are
# generated locally from retrieved facts (still fully grounded).
# Groq (fast + free):  LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# OpenAI:              LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# Local Ollama:        LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
LLM_API_KEY=
LLM_BASE_URL=
LLM_MODEL=